      "content": "it's just... it's not even about being sad anymore. it's just this sense that staying is so much more difficult than just letting go. the fog doesn't ask anything of me. it doesn't require me to pretend to be okay or keep up the pretense of living. there's something so much more honest about the stillness of the end compared to the noise of trying to survive.",
